 (`k > 0`), needs to be correctly mapped to the wheel's local rotation axis. Analysis of the bone's orientation and rotation logic is underway to ensure the steering action is not inverted.\n\nVerification is necessary to guarantee a left turn results in the correct counter-clockwise rotation of the steering wheel. This validation includes a check to ensure the steering ratio (10:1 - 12:1) is applied correctly. The python test script will check if the visual result matches the expected direction.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"read_board","args":{"since":"8"}}]}
