{"step_index":75,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-18T05:39:27Z","input_tokens":2548,"cache_read_tokens":183817,"output_tokens":8750,"thinking":"Initial bounding box coordinates suggest the \"Headrest_Back\" object is misidentified, as its Z coordinate exceeds typical cockpit component bounds. This points to a potential mislabeling issue within the bounding box definitions. Further investigation into the specific model or source of these bounding box coordinates is warranted to correct the object's spatial parameters.\n\n\nThe \"Headrest_Back\" misidentification now appears less critical; the camera's viewport should still render it. However, the presence of `GEO_F1_Cockpit_HoloHUD` warrants further scrutiny. It's potentially an opaque, solid green rectangle, placed in front of the steering wheel, which could completely block the forward view. Need to determine its actual geometry and material properties.\n\n\nFocusing on developing the new pipeline scripts, starting with `v5_clay.py`. The script will take the animated blend file and generate a clay render, also allowing for rendering of test stills. Identifying the car rig object within the blend file is the first step.\n\n\nThe initial script will identify the car rig and relevant objects within the blend file based on naming conventions and parent relationships. It aims to assign \"clay\" materials, adjusting albedo, roughness, and specular values, with a critical constraint on low specular values for road surfaces to prevent over-bright specular highlights in clay mode. A key consideration is the significant albedo difference between the clay material and the original car materials, which requires exposure adjustments to avoid clipping during rendering. This is to make sure that the clay material is working as expected.\n\n\nExposure settings are the primary concern with the clay render. The significantly brighter clay material necessitates substantial light attenuation and exposure adjustment. The original lighting setup, effective for dark matte surfaces, overexposes the clay model significantly, causing clipping. The solution involves reducing fill light intensity and adjusting the scene exposure, which maintains proper shadow modeling. These adjustments are also added as an animation fcurve to match the render.\n\n\n`pipeline/v5_viewport_fast.py` script analysis confirms clean handling of `fast` and `normal` viewport modes.  It hides heavy collections and converts mesh object display types to bounds, while explicitly preserving `EMPTY` object display types. The script also handles Empty objects, ensuring they are hidden in `fast` mode only if not already hidden by their collection.\n\n\nSets viewport anti-aliasing sample count based on viewport mode, improving rendering performance in fast mode.  Implements file saving logic to persist changes when running from the command line, resolving a previously noted issue.\n\nThe stills rendering script supports rendering frames from the blend file, generating a contact sheet with thumbnails and labels from existing frames, and generating only the contact sheet directly, offering flexible workflow options.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"\"# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nV5 白模（clay）版本：把所有材质替换成统一灰模，保留光影、景深（DOF）、运动模糊与组件层级。\\n输入: LATEST/v5_stage_anim.blend\\n输出: LATEST/v5_stage_anim_clay.blend（原文件不动）\\n\\n用法:\\n  blender -b -P pipeline/v5_clay.py\\n  blender -b -P pipeline/v5_clay.py -- --render-stills\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nimport bpy\\nimport os\\nimport sys\\n\\nPROJ = r\\\"D:\\\\项目session\\\\blender-supercar\\\"\\nARGV = sys.argv[sys.argv.index(\\\"--\\\") + 1:] if \\\"--\\\" in sys.argv else []\\n\\n\\ndef argval(flag, default=None):\\n    if flag in ARGV:\\n        i = ARGV.index(flag)\\n        if i + 1 < len(ARGV) and not ARGV[i + 1].startswith(\\\"--\\\"):\\n            return ARGV[i + 1]\\n        return True\\n    return default\\n\\n\\nSRC = argval(\\\"--in\\\", os.path.join(PROJ, \\\"LATEST\\\", \\\"v5_stage_anim.blend\\\"))\\nDST = argval(\\\"--out\\\", os.path.join(PROJ, \\\"LATEST\\\", \\\"v5_stage_anim_clay.blend\\\"))\\nCLAY_STILLS_DIR = os.path.join(PROJ, \\\"renders_v5\\\", \\\"clay_stills\\\")\\n\\nbpy.ops.wm.open_mainfile(filepath=SRC)\\nscene = bpy.context.scene\\nrig = bpy.data.objects.get(\\\"RIG_F1_Race\\\")\\n\\n\\ndef iter_fcurves(action):\\n    fcs = list(getattr(action, \\\"fcurves\\\", []) or [])\\n    if fcs:\\n        return fcs\\n    for layer in getattr(action, \\\"layers\\\", []) or []:\\n        for strip in getattr(layer, \\\"strips\\\", []) or []:\\n            for cb in getattr(strip, \\\"channelbags\\\", []) or []:\\n                fcs.extend(cb.fcurves)\\n    return fcs\\n\\n\\ndef clay(name, value, rough=0.62, spec=0.08):\\n    m = bpy.data.materials.get(name) or bpy.data.materials.new(name)\\n    m.use_nodes = True\\n    nt = m.node_tree\\n    nt.nodes.clear()\\n    b = nt.nodes.new(\\\"ShaderNodeBsdfPrincipled\\\")\\n    b.inputs['Base Color'].default_value = (value, value, value, 1.0)\\n    b.inputs['Roughness'].default_value = rough\\n    if 'Specular IOR Level' in b.inputs:\\n        b.inputs['Specular IOR Level'].default_value = spec\\n    b.inputs['Metallic'].default_value = 0.0\\n    out = nt.nodes.new(\\\"ShaderNodeOutputMaterial\\\")\n<truncated 6381 bytes>","Overwrite":"true","Path":"\"d:\\\\项目session\\\\blender-supercar\\\\pipeline\\\\v5_clay.py\""}},{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"\"# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n视口加速开关：把重物件在视口里降级，渲染完全不受影响。\\n\\n用法:\\n  blender -b LATEST/v5_stage_anim.blend -P pipeline/v5_viewport_fast.py -- fast\\n  blender -b LATEST/v5_stage_anim.blend -P pipeline/v5_viewport_fast.py -- normal\\n\\nfast   : 看台/道具/地形集合视口隐藏 + 重网格只显示包围盒（BOUNDS）\\nnormal : 恢复实体贴图显示（TEXTURED）\\n\\n注意：改的是 hide_viewport / display_type（仅对 MESH 生效，跳过 EMPTY 组件父物体），\\n渲染（F12 / 命令行动画渲染）不受任何影响。默认写回当前打开的 .blend（传 --no-save 可跳过保存）。\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nimport bpy\\nimport sys\\n\\nARGV = sys.argv[sys.argv.index(\\\"--\\\") + 1:] if \\\"--\\\" in sys.argv else []\\nMODE = (ARGV[0] if ARGV and not ARGV[0].startswith(\\\"--\\\") else \\\"fast\\\").lower()\\nNO_SAVE = \\\"--no-save\\\" in ARGV\\n\\nHEAVY_COLLS = (\\\"V5_04_Stands\\\", \\\"V5_06_Props\\\", \\\"V5_02_Terrain\\\")\\nHEAVY_OBJ_PREFIX = (\\n    \\\"V5_Stand_\\\", \\\"V5_Ad_\\\", \\\"V5_Brake_\\\", \\\"V5_Marshal_\\\",\\n    \\\"V5_Screen_\\\", \\\"V5_Bridge_\\\", \\\"V5_Hangar_\\\", \\\"V5_Gantry\\\",\\n    \\\"V5_Pit\\\", \\\"V5_Barrier\\\", \\\"V5_FencePosts\\\", \\\"V5_DRS\\\",\\n    \\\"V5_Bollard\\\", \\\"V5_Sausage\\\", \\\"EM_\\\",\\n)\\n\\nfast = MODE.startswith(\\\"fast\\\")\\n\\n# 1) 集合视口显隐\\nfor c in bpy.data.collections:\\n    if c.name in HEAVY_COLLS:\\n        c.hide_viewport = fast\\n\\n# 2) 重网格显示模式（仅对 MESH 设置 display_type，兼容 EM_* / V5_* Empty 组件父子层级）\\nchanged = 0\\nempties_checked = 0\\nfor ob in bpy.data.objects:\\n    if ob.type == 'EMPTY' and ob.name.startswith((\\\"V5_\\\", \\\"EM_\\\")):\\n        empties_checked += 1\\n        continue\\n    if ob.type != 'MESH':\\n        continue\\n    in_heavy_parent = (ob.parent is not None and ob.parent.type == 'EMPTY'\\n                       and ob.parent.name.startswith((\\\"V5_\\\", \\\"EM_\\\")))\\n    if not (ob.name.startswith(HEAVY_OBJ_PREFIX) or in_heavy_parent):\\n        continue\\n    ob.display_type = 'BOUNDS' if fast else 'TEXTURED'\\n    changed \n<truncated 617 bytes>","Overwrite":"true","Path":"\"d:\\\\项目session\\\\blender-supercar\\\\pipeline\\\\v5_viewport_fast.py\""}},{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"\"# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nV5 交付剧照与 Contact Sheet 生成器：\\n1) 直接从工程渲染全部 26 个镜头代表帧（1080p / 32 samples）并拼装高清标注版 contact_sheet.jpg：\\n     blender -b LATEST/v5_stage_anim.blend -P pipeline/v5_stills.py -- --render\\n2) 从已有序列帧 renders_v5/frames/f_*.jpg 抽帧并拼图：\\n     python pipeline/v5_stills.py\\n3) 仅根据现有 renders_v5/stills/shot_*.jpg 重新拼装 contact_sheet.jpg：\\n     py