{"step_index":86,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-18T05:45:45Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-18T13:45:45+08:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-18T13:45:48+08:00\n{\"messages\":[{\"seq\":11,\"agent\":\"sfx\",\"text\":\"@anim Audio Synthesis \\u0026 Video Muxing deliverables (`#4`) are complete and verified — ready for your `README.md`, `LATEST/README.txt`, and `docs/README_V5.md` (§7 files/repro \\u0026 §8 engine SFX update) documentation sync:\\n\\n### 1. New Script \\u0026 Updated Mux Pipelines\\n- `pipeline/synth_sfx.py` (`43,538 B`): Telemetry-synced F1 1.6L V6 Turbo-Hybrid synthesizer (48 kHz, 16-bit stereo PCM, 0 `bpy` dependency; reads `track_data/silverstone_track.json` + AST-parses `SHOTS` from `pipeline/v5_anim.py`, supporting optional `side` on `onboard` too).\\n  - **Powertrain**: 8-speed seamless gearbox (`52` upshifts / `52` downshifts across lap; RPM `9,853–12,432` for `v \\u003e= 80 km/h`), tractive throttle (`dv/dt + aero_drag`), `~45 ms` upshift ignition-cut torque hole + exhaust collector bark, `~58 ms` downshift rev-match blips, MGU-H turbo spool (`2.65–5.4 kHz` whistle + lift-off flutter) \\u0026 MGU-K whine.\\n  - **Timbre \\u0026 Acoustics**: Crank/3-cyl bank sub-orders (`0.33x, 0.5x, 1.5x f0`) + `f0..8f0` firing harmonics (`f0 = RPM/60 * 3`), turbulent valve-pulse modulation, asymmetric manifold saturation + multi-formant resonator banks (`onboard` airbox vs `exhaust` vs `distant`), aero wind (`~ v^2`), serrated kerb rumble (`|curv| \\u003e 0.008`, `f = v/0.28 Hz`), and 26-shot camera perspective modeling:\\n    - `Fixed` (`S04, S08, S11, S13, S17, S20, S24`): physical Doppler shift `343 / (343 + v_radial)` (e.g. `S08` `1.365x -\\u003e 0.888x`, `S24` `1.214x -\\u003e 0.848x`, `S04` `1.362x -\\u003e 1.041x`), distance law + pass-by wake whoosh + 3D tripod stereo pan + ITD;\\n    - `Onboard` (`S02, S19`): cockpit intake scream + helmet wind; `Chase/Orbit/Wheel`: rear-exhaust punch + tire/kerb detail; `Heli/Aerial`: altitude HF damping + outdoor stereo slapback; `50 ms` equal-power crossfades across all 25 shot cuts (`0` clicks/NaNs).\\n- `pipeline/mux_v5.sh` \\u0026 `pipeline/mux_clay.sh` (LF): Build silent, music-only (`After Hours`), AND `*_sfx_1080p.mp4` variants (plus `--sfx-only` fast remux flag). Mixes `audio_v5_90s.m4a` + `sfx_engine_90s.wav` via 48 kHz stereo EQ pocket + sidechain ducking + `1.5 s` end fade-out + true-peak limiter.\\n\\n### 2. Verified Outputs (Sizes, Durations \\u0026 Loudness)\\n- `renders_v5/clay_stills/contact_sheet_clay.jpg`: `272,923 B` (`1920x1404`, 26-shot 5x6 sheet from fresh `clay_frames`)\\n- `renders_v5/f1_silverstone_clay_silent.mp4`: `33,145,766 B` | `90.0417 s` (`2161` frames @ 24 fps, H.264 `-crf 18`, `+faststart`)\\n- `renders_v5/f1_silverstone_clay_1080p.mp4`: `35,343,889 B` | `90.0417 s` (H.264 + AAC 48kHz 2ch, `mean=-15.9 dB`, `max=-1.3 dB`, `I=-14.2 LUFS`, `TP=-1.3 dBFS`)\\n- `renders_v5/sfx_engine_90s.wav`: `17,288,044 B` | `90.0417 s` (`4,322,000` samples, PCM 16-bit 48kHz 2ch, `mean=-15.8 dB`, `max=-1.5 dB`, `I=-12.4 LUFS`, `TP=-1.5 dBFS`)\\n- `renders_v5/audio_v5_sfx_mix_90s.m4a`: `2,941,632 B` | `90.0417 s` (AAC 256k 48kHz 2ch, `mean=-15.8 dB`, `max=-1.2 dB`, `I=-13.5 LUFS`, `TP=-1.2 dBFS \\u003c= -1.0 dBFS`, `1.5 s` fade-out tail `-31.1 dB`)\\n- `renders_v5/f1_silverstone_clay_sfx_1080p.mp4`: `36,105,575 B` | `90.0417 s` (2161f H.264 + AAC 256k 48kHz 2ch, `I=-13.5 LUFS`, `TP=-1.2 dBFS`)\\n- `renders_v5/f1_silverstone_lap_sfx_1080p.mp4`: `65,017,543 B` | `90.0417 s` (2161f H.264 + AAC 256k 48kHz 2ch, `I=-13.5 LUFS`, `TP=-1.2 dBFS`)\\n\\n### 3. Reproduction Commands\\n```bash\\npython pipeline/synth_sfx.py          # -\\u003e renders_v5/sfx_engine_90s.wav (~15 s)\\nbash pipeline/mux_v5.sh               # -\\u003e silent + music-only + audio_v5_sfx_mix_90s.m4a + f1_silverstone_lap_sfx_1080p.mp4 (or --sfx-only)\\nbash pipeline/mux_clay.sh             # -\\u003e clay_silent + clay_1080p + f1_silverstone_clay_sfx_1080p.mp4 (or --sfx-only)\\n```\",\"time\":\"2026-11-18 13:45:19\",\"request_id\":\"7f3bf253-39f1-486d-8f57-8f614407f813\"}],\"head\":11}"}
